INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771378372782', 'Serato DJ Pro Suite 4.0.2', 'Serato DJ Pro Overview Serato DJ Pro is a leading software solution for professional DJs and music enthusiasts. With its comprehensive features and intuitive interface, Serato DJ Pro revolutionizes the art of DJing, offering advanced tools for mixing, blending, and manipulating music. In this article, we will explore the remarkable features, benefits, and applications of Serato DJ Pro, shedding light on how this software empowers DJs to take their performances to new heights and deliver unforgettable experiences to their audiences.  Unleashing the Power of Serato DJ Pro: Serato DJ Pro is a comprehensive software solution that empowers DJs to unleash their creativity and elevate their performances. With its powerful features, seamless integration with hardware, and intuitive interface, Serato DJ Pro sets the standard for professional DJ software. Whether you''re a beginner or a seasoned pro, Serato DJ Pro provides the tools and functionality needed to create unique mixes and engage with your audience.  Key Features of Serato DJ Pro: Seamless Music Mixing and Blending: Precise beatmatching and key detection algorithms for smooth transitions between tracks. High-quality time-stretching and pitch-shifting capabilities to match the tempo and key of different songs seamlessly. Advanced Performance Tools: Extensive range of DJ-friendly effects, including echo, reverb, flanger, and more, to add depth and creativity to your mixes. Built-in sampler for triggering and looping samples, enhancing live performances, and remixing possibilities. Robust Library Management: Efficient library management tools for organizing and categorizing your music collection. Advanced search and sorting options to quickly locate tracks, making it easy to find the perfect song for your mix. Wide Range of Hardware Support: Serato DJ Pro integrates with various DJ controllers, mixers, and interfaces from leading manufacturers. Extensive MIDI mapping capabilities allow customization and control of your hardware to suit your unique workflow. Seamless Music Mixing and Blending Serato DJ Pro provides DJs with precise beatmatching and key detection algorithms, ensuring smooth transitions between tracks. The software''s advanced time-stretching and pitch-shifting capabilities allow DJs to effortlessly match the tempo and key of different songs, creating seamless mixes that keep the energy flowing on the dancefloor.  Advanced Performance Tools: Serato DJ Pro offers a wide range of DJ-friendly effects, enabling DJs to add their signature touch to their mixes. From classic effects like echo and reverb to creative tools like flanger and phaser, the software empowers DJs to shape the sound and create captivating moments during their performances. The built-in sampler further enhances live performances and remixing possibilities, allowing DJs to trigger and loop samples on the fly.  Robust Library Management: Efficient library management is crucial for DJs, and Serato DJ Pro provides powerful tools to organize and navigate your music collection. The software''s comprehensive library management features enable DJs to categorize tracks, create playlists, and add custom tags for easy access. The advanced search and sorting options make finding the right track at the right moment quick and effortless, ensuring a seamless mixing experience.  Wide Range of Hardware Support: Serato DJ Pro seamlessly integrates with renowned manufacturers'' various DJ controllers, mixers, and interfaces. The software''s extensive MIDI mapping capabilities allow DJs to customize their hardware and take complete control over their performance. With Serato DJ Pro, you can choose the hardware that suits your preferences and workflow, ensuring a personalized and immersive DJing experience.  Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs): Q1: Can Serato DJ Pro be used with both Windows and macOS? A: Serato DJ Pro is compatible with Windows and macOS operating systems, providing flexibility for DJs using different platforms.  Q2: Is Serato DJ Pro suitable for beginners? A: Absolutely! Serato DJ Pro offers an intuitive interface and user-friendly features, making it accessible for beginners while providing advanced tools for professional DJs.  Q3: Can I use Serato DJ Pro with my existing DJ controller? A: Serato DJ Pro supports a wide range of DJ controllers, mixers, and interfaces from various manufacturers. Check the Serato website for the list of supported hardware.  Q4: Does Serato DJ Pro offer support and updates? A: Yes, Serato provides regular software updates and offers comprehensive customer support to assist users with any technical inquiries or issues.  Q5: Can I use Serato DJ Pro for live performances and recording mixes? A: Absolutely! Serato DJ Pro is designed for live performances, allowing DJs to mix and record their sets with professional-grade quality.  Conclusion: Serato DJ Pro is a powerful software solution that empowers DJs to unleash their creativity, deliver exceptional perf', 850, 'Software', 'https://pub-8ce7dd1a0bfc42fb9e3a130e1f5f5aae.r2.dev/images/products/p1771378372782_main.jpeg', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771536830070', '100W Tear-Resistant Durability C to C Cable OCD-1525CC', 'Model: OCD-1525CC (BraidLine) Type: USB-C to USB-C Charging Power: 100W (Max), 5A Data Transfer Speed: 480 Mbps Length: 1 Meter Durability: Tear-resistant braided material Fast Charging Protocols: PD3.0 & QC3.0 compatible   This cable is designed for high-power,, long-lasting use, capable of charging demanding devices like laptops, ensuring both speed and structural integrity during daily use', 500, 'Cables', 'https://pub-8ce7dd1a0bfc42fb9e3a130e1f5f5aae.r2.dev/images/products/p1771536830070_main.webp', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771378555132', 'Serato DJ Pro Suite 4.0.0', 'Overview of Serato DJ Pro Suite for macOS If you''re a professional DJ looking for the best software to enhance your performances, look no further than Serato DJ Suite for macOS. This powerful software, developed by Serato, is packed with features that will take your DJ skills to the next level.  Features of Serato DJ Pro Suite for macOS Enhanced DJ tools: The Serato DJ Suite includes a range of advanced DJ tools, such as beatmatching, looping, and syncing, to help you create seamless mixes Advanced audio effects: The software comes with a range of audio effects, including echo, reverb, and delay, to help you add an extra flair to your sets DJ performance modes: The Serato DJ Suite includes several performance modes, including Slip Mode and Serato Flip, to help you add creative touches to your sets Expansive library: The software allows you to access a vast library of tracks and beats, so you''ll always have a wide range of music to choose from for your sets DJ hardware integration: The Serato DJ Suite is compatible with a range of DJ hardware, including controllers, mixers, and turntables, so that you can use the software with your preferred equipment Serato DJ Pro Suite includes Serato DJ Pro Serato Video Serato DVS Serato FX Serato Flip Serato Pitch ''n Time DJ Technical Details and System Requirements macOS 11.0 or later Apple Silicon or Intel Core processor FAQs Q: Is it beginner-friendly? A: Yes, the software includes a range of tutorials and helpful resources to guide you through the features and functions, making it suitable for beginners. However, as with any DJ software, it may take some time and practice to master the various tools and techniques.  Q: Can I use it with my music library? A: The software allows you to import tracks and beats from your music library and use them in your sets.  Conclusion It is a must-have for any professional DJ looking to take their performances to the next level. With its advanced DJ tools, audio effects, performance modes, and expansive library, it''s the ultimate software for creating seamless mixes and adding creative touches to your sets.', 850, 'Software', 'https://pub-8ce7dd1a0bfc42fb9e3a130e1f5f5aae.r2.dev/images/products/p1771378555132_main.webp', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771378781342', 'Pioneer DJ Rekordbox 6.8.4', 'Overview of Pioneer DJ Rekordbox Premium Rekordbox DJ''s GUI is perfectly matched with the layout of your hardware no matter what player or device you are using, including the new DDJ-RR and DDJ-RB. It''s simply the most effortless, intuitive software imaginable.  The FX, waveform, players, sampler, and browser mirror your hardware exactly, and you can choose from a 2/4 deck with horizontal or vertical views. Hot Cues, Sampler, and other effects offer intuitive operation to match the same layout as the pad control section in our DJ controller.  You can easily mix your playlist with confidence and accuracy. An all-new phrase analysis algorithm detects track phrases in Rekordbox''s KORETECH engine. In addition, Automix uses track information, such as beat position, BPM, and key, to produce natural mixes. You are free to scratch, apply FX, and change the order of tracks whenever you want.  Features of Pioneer DJ Rekordbox Premium  Professional sound quality Lowest latency in the business Multi-deck mixing Visual brilliance Auto Mix Upload your DJ Mix easily More lights, more action One music library, unlimited control Technical Details and System Requirements Supported OS: Windows 11, Windows 10, Windows 8.1, Windows 7 RAM (Memory): 2 GB RAM (4 GB recommended) Free Hard Disk Space: 800 MB or more', 700, 'Software', 'https://pub-8ce7dd1a0bfc42fb9e3a130e1f5f5aae.r2.dev/images/products/p1771378781342_main.webp', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771379048760', 'Pioneer DJ rekordbox 5.8.6.0004 Premium', 'Overview of Pioneer DJ rekordbox It''s a worldwide database solution for organizing playlists and music that works with all of our devices, whether you''re utilizing multi-players, DJ controllers, or a DVS setup. With this program, you can now bring your entire music library to the club on an SD or USB device, plug it in, and play.  They re-examined the audio, graphic, and video signal processing program to develop KORETECH. This next-generation engine makes rekordbox a more lightweight and stable application with great features and performance. Furthermore, the improved USB/SD export function makes managing your music library even easier than before.  It also has a new user interface with a logical architecture that makes it simple to manage your music collection and perform intuitively with the rekordbox DJ, DVS, and video Plus Packs.  Features of Pioneer DJ rekordbox Improved core for light and stable performance Advanced and accurate track analysis Improved USB/SD export features New GUI for easy use Technical Details and System Requirements macOS 10.14 or later Intel Core processor', 700, 'Software', 'https://pub-8ce7dd1a0bfc42fb9e3a130e1f5f5aae.r2.dev/images/products/p1771379048760_main.webp', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771379228011', 'Atomix VirtualDJ 2025 Pro Infinity 8.5.8472', 'Atomix VirtualDJ Pro Infinity Overview DJs use VirtualDJ to replace their turntables and CD players and use digital music instead of vinyl and CDs. Virtual DJ is compatible with time-coded pieces of vinyl that let you scratch your MP3s directly on an absolute turntable and with many other DJ equipment, save for each song and an extensive collection of excellent automatically synchronized effects. Virtual DJ Pro Infinity has more functionality and lets you do new things that were only possible on DJ software, from scratching video clips to producing complex remixes.  Atomix VirtualDJ Pro (better known as VirtualDJ Pro or Virtual DJ Pro) has been used by millions of DJs and hobbies to replace traditional tools and make their mixes incredibly fast. In addition, the Infinity version lets them add an unlimited number of cue points and save for each song automatically beat-synchronized effects.  Features of Atomix Virtual DJ Pro Infinity Play an unlimited number of samples simultaneously. Mix while the audience is still listening to the previous song Drag and drop samples directly onto the slots Automatically detect and fill the remix points Jump to the end of the current track with ease Audio components, like pitch-stretching, limiter, equalizers, filters, etc. System Requirements and Technical Details Supported OS: Windows 11 / Windows 10 / Windows 8.1 / Windows 7 Processor: Multicore Intel Series or above, Xeon or AMD equivalent RAM: 4GB (8GB or more recommended) Free Hard Disk Space: 4GB or more recommended', 700, 'Software', 'https://pub-8ce7dd1a0bfc42fb9e3a130e1f5f5aae.r2.dev/images/products/p1771379228011_main.jpeg', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771379464556', 'MAGIX ACID Pro 11.0.2.21', 'Overview of MAGIX ACID Pro Benefits It is a powerful 64-bit DAW that features ACID''s famous innovative audio looping technology, powerful multitrack recording, and hi-end audio and MIDI features - all set within an easy-to-use interface to help artists of all levels bring their musical aspirations into reality.  This new version introduces a new GUI but the same famous workflow, creating an exciting and creative music production environment: 64-bit processing, no less than 16 new instruments, 13 new effect plug-ins, and 9 GB of new ACIDized loops. Plus, VST3 support is coming soon in a free update giving you access to thousands of third-party plug-ins.  Overview of MAGIX ACID Pro Features The creative DAW for sample- and loop-based music production NEW! ACID Morph Pads Celemony Melodyne essential NEW! Sidechaining NEW! Transient detection in the MIDI Playable Chopper Remix Tool NEW! Instruments, effects, and ACIDized loops Technical Details and System Requirements Windows 10, Windows 8, Windows 7 Processor: 1 GHz (multicore or multiprocessor recommended) RAM: 1 GB (8 GB recommended) Graphics card: Onboard, min. resolution 1024 x 768 Sound card: Onboard Hard drive space: 500 MB for program installation Program languages: Deutsch, English, Español, Français', 500, 'Software', 'https://pub-8ce7dd1a0bfc42fb9e3a130e1f5f5aae.r2.dev/images/products/p1771379464556_main.png', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771379681819', 'MAGIX ACID Pro Next Suite 1.0.3.32 64-bit version', 'Overview of MAGIX ACID Pro Next Suite Benefits With a worlds first for any DAW, ACID Pro Next combines cutting edge sampling technology, a fully featured DAW and unique ACIDized loops that lock in time and key with your new compositions. To show you everything that ACID Pro Next has to offer, we sat down together with producer Iain Duncan in our studio.  Only the ACID Pro Next Suite comes with additional bonus instruments and add-ons. Also included: The incredible Independence Pro Plus Suite with 12 GB of sounds and 500 presets, 10 exclusive Vita instruments (including Power Guitar, Bass Machine and String Ensemble), 9 exclusive effects (including Vandal guitar-effects and the Vintage Effects Suite), plus two extra bundles of ACID loops for Funky House and 80s Hip Hop.  It delivers all the effects you need for the perfect mixing experience and also offers very flexible mastering solutions. Premium professional effect plug-ins include the Analogue Modelling Suite, the Vintage Effects Suite, VariVerb II reverb and Vandal guitar effects.  Overview of MAGIX ACID Pro Next Suite Features The ultimate next-gen music production suite Sophisticated features, professional results The first DAW with integrated audio separation technology: zynaptiq STEM MAKER MIDI Playable Chopper performance tool Melodyne essential and 32-bit bridge technology 10 extra instruments and 9 bonus effects Bonus sample bundle includes two extra packs of loops Independence Pro Plus Suite with 12 GB of sounds and 500 presets Technical Details and System Requirements Supported OS: Windows 7/8/10 RAM: 4 GB RAM Free Hard Disk Space: 1 GB or more', 500, 'Software', 'https://pub-8ce7dd1a0bfc42fb9e3a130e1f5f5aae.r2.dev/images/products/p1771379681819_main.jpeg', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771379819628', 'MAGIX ACID Pro Next Suite 1.0.3.32 32-bit version', 'Overview of MAGIX ACID Pro Next Suite Benefits With a worlds first for any DAW, ACID Pro Next combines cutting edge sampling technology, a fully featured DAW and unique ACIDized loops that lock in time and key with your new compositions. To show you everything that ACID Pro Next has to offer, we sat down together with producer Iain Duncan in our studio.  Only the ACID Pro Next Suite comes with additional bonus instruments and add-ons. Also included: The incredible Independence Pro Plus Suite with 12 GB of sounds and 500 presets, 10 exclusive Vita instruments (including Power Guitar, Bass Machine and String Ensemble), 9 exclusive effects (including Vandal guitar-effects and the Vintage Effects Suite), plus two extra bundles of ACID loops for Funky House and 80s Hip Hop.  It delivers all the effects you need for the perfect mixing experience and also offers very flexible mastering solutions. Premium professional effect plug-ins include the Analogue Modelling Suite, the Vintage Effects Suite, VariVerb II reverb and Vandal guitar effects.  Overview of MAGIX ACID Pro Next Suite Features The ultimate next-gen music production suite Sophisticated features, professional results The first DAW with integrated audio separation technology: zynaptiq STEM MAKER MIDI Playable Chopper performance tool Melodyne essential and 32-bit bridge technology 10 extra instruments and 9 bonus effects Bonus sample bundle includes two extra packs of loops Independence Pro Plus Suite with 12 GB of sounds and 500 presets Technical Details and System Requirements Supported OS: Windows 7/8/10 RAM: 4 GB RAM Free Hard Disk Space: 1 GB or more', 500, 'Software', 'https://pub-8ce7dd1a0bfc42fb9e3a130e1f5f5aae.r2.dev/images/products/p1771379819628_main.jpeg', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771380022611', 'MAGIX VEGAS Pro 23.0.0.356', 'Overview of MAGIX Vegas Pro  VEGAS Pro is the Creative Software from MAGIX Corporation for Professional Video, Audio, and Blue-ray Disc Creating! Only Vegas combines real-time SD, HD, 2K, and 4K video editing with unrivaled audio tools to provide the ultimate all-in-one environment for creative professionals. High-definition and high-fidelity.  VEGAS Pro gives you more editing power than ever before. With new velocity limits, you can create a fast motion that’s 40 times faster than the average speed. New hover scrub capabilities make marking in and out points and adding footage from the Trimmer much faster and more efficient. That leaves more time for your main goal: creating impressive videos.  Make complete HD recordings stand out in top quality with intelligent plug-ins, even in 4K projects. Incorporate your HD archival footage in 4K projects with Smart Upscaling and Smart Zoom tools. Deliver your project in a variety of standard 4K file formats.  Features of MAGIX Vegas Pro Innovative editing tools Stereoscopic 3D editing Superior audio control ProRes 4444 files with embedded alpha channels Support for 8K files through proxy workflow NVENC 10-bit HEVC rendering HEVC/XAVC Support System Requirements and Technical Details Operating system: Microsoft Windows 10/11 Processor: 6th Generation Intel Core i5 (or AMD equivalent) or better with 2.5 GHz and 4 Cores RAM: 16 GB RAM Hard drive space: 1.5 GB hard-disk space for program installation; Solid-state disk (SSD) or high-speed multi-disk RAID for 4K media Graphics card: Supported NVIDIA, AMD/ATI, or Intel GPU with at least 512 MB of memory (1 GB recommended for 4K and GPU-accelerated video processing)', 500, 'Software', 'https://pub-8ce7dd1a0bfc42fb9e3a130e1f5f5aae.r2.dev/images/products/p1771380022611_main.webp', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771380223775', 'Serato DJ Pro Suite v3.3.5 macOS', 'Overview of Serato DJ Pro Suite for macOS If you''re a professional DJ looking for the best software to enhance your performances, look no further than Serato DJ Suite for macOS. This powerful software, developed by Serato, is packed with features that will take your DJ skills to the next level.  Features of Serato DJ Pro Suite for macOS Enhanced DJ tools: The Serato DJ Suite includes a range of advanced DJ tools, such as beatmatching, looping, and syncing, to help you create seamless mixes Advanced audio effects: The software comes with a range of audio effects, including echo, reverb, and delay, to help you add an extra flair to your sets DJ performance modes: The Serato DJ Suite includes several performance modes, including Slip Mode and Serato Flip, to help you add creative touches to your sets Expansive library: The software allows you to access a vast library of tracks and beats, so you''ll always have a wide range of music to choose from for your sets DJ hardware integration: The Serato DJ Suite is compatible with a range of DJ hardware, including controllers, mixers, and turntables, so that you can use the software with your preferred equipment Serato DJ Pro Suite includes Serato DJ Pro Serato Video Serato DVS Serato FX Serato Flip Serato Pitch ''n Time DJ Technical Details and System Requirements macOS 11.0 or later Apple Silicon or Intel Core processor FAQs Q: Is it beginner-friendly? A: Yes, the software includes a range of tutorials and helpful resources to guide you through the features and functions, making it suitable for beginners. However, as with any DJ software, it may take some time and practice to master the various tools and techniques.  Q: Can I use it with my music library? A: The software allows you to import tracks and beats from your music library and use them in your sets.  Conclusion It is a must-have for any professional DJ looking to take their performances to the next level. With its advanced DJ tools, audio effects, performance modes, and expansive library, it''s the ultimate software for creating seamless mixes and adding creative touches to your sets.', 700, 'Software', 'https://pub-8ce7dd1a0bfc42fb9e3a130e1f5f5aae.r2.dev/images/products/p1771380223775_main.webp', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771380448179', 'Serato DJ Pro Suite 3.3.5 Windows', 'Serato DJ Pro Overview Serato DJ Pro is a leading software solution for professional DJs and music enthusiasts. With its comprehensive features and intuitive interface, Serato DJ Pro revolutionizes the art of DJing, offering advanced tools for mixing, blending, and manipulating music. In this article, we will explore the remarkable features, benefits, and applications of Serato DJ Pro, shedding light on how this software empowers DJs to take their performances to new heights and deliver unforgettable experiences to their audiences.  Unleashing the Power of Serato DJ Pro: Serato DJ Pro is a comprehensive software solution that empowers DJs to unleash their creativity and elevate their performances. With its powerful features, seamless integration with hardware, and intuitive interface, Serato DJ Pro sets the standard for professional DJ software. Whether you''re a beginner or a seasoned pro, Serato DJ Pro provides the tools and functionality needed to create unique mixes and engage with your audience.  Key Features of Serato DJ Pro: Seamless Music Mixing and Blending: Precise beatmatching and key detection algorithms for smooth transitions between tracks. High-quality time-stretching and pitch-shifting capabilities to match the tempo and key of different songs seamlessly. Advanced Performance Tools: Extensive range of DJ-friendly effects, including echo, reverb, flanger, and more, to add depth and creativity to your mixes. Built-in sampler for triggering and looping samples, enhancing live performances, and remixing possibilities. Robust Library Management: Efficient library management tools for organizing and categorizing your music collection. Advanced search and sorting options to quickly locate tracks, making it easy to find the perfect song for your mix. Wide Range of Hardware Support: Serato DJ Pro integrates with various DJ controllers, mixers, and interfaces from leading manufacturers. Extensive MIDI mapping capabilities allow customization and control of your hardware to suit your unique workflow. Seamless Music Mixing and Blending Serato DJ Pro provides DJs with precise beatmatching and key detection algorithms, ensuring smooth transitions between tracks. The software''s advanced time-stretching and pitch-shifting capabilities allow DJs to effortlessly match the tempo and key of different songs, creating seamless mixes that keep the energy flowing on the dancefloor.  Advanced Performance Tools: Serato DJ Pro offers a wide range of DJ-friendly effects, enabling DJs to add their signature touch to their mixes. From classic effects like echo and reverb to creative tools like flanger and phaser, the software empowers DJs to shape the sound and create captivating moments during their performances. The built-in sampler further enhances live performances and remixing possibilities, allowing DJs to trigger and loop samples on the fly.  Robust Library Management: Efficient library management is crucial for DJs, and Serato DJ Pro provides powerful tools to organize and navigate your music collection. The software''s comprehensive library management features enable DJs to categorize tracks, create playlists, and add custom tags for easy access. The advanced search and sorting options make finding the right track at the right moment quick and effortless, ensuring a seamless mixing experience.  Wide Range of Hardware Support: Serato DJ Pro seamlessly integrates with renowned manufacturers'' various DJ controllers, mixers, and interfaces. The software''s extensive MIDI mapping capabilities allow DJs to customize their hardware and take complete control over their performance. With Serato DJ Pro, you can choose the hardware that suits your preferences and workflow, ensuring a personalized and immersive DJing experience.  Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs): Q1: Can Serato DJ Pro be used with both Windows and macOS? A: Serato DJ Pro is compatible with Windows and macOS operating systems, providing flexibility for DJs using different platforms.  Q2: Is Serato DJ Pro suitable for beginners? A: Absolutely! Serato DJ Pro offers an intuitive interface and user-friendly features, making it accessible for beginners while providing advanced tools for professional DJs.  Q3: Can I use Serato DJ Pro with my existing DJ controller? A: Serato DJ Pro supports a wide range of DJ controllers, mixers, and interfaces from various manufacturers. Check the Serato website for the list of supported hardware.  Q4: Does Serato DJ Pro offer support and updates? A: Yes, Serato provides regular software updates and offers comprehensive customer support to assist users with any technical inquiries or issues.  Q5: Can I use Serato DJ Pro for live performances and recording mixes? A: Absolutely! Serato DJ Pro is designed for live performances, allowing DJs to mix and record their sets with professional-grade quality.  Conclusion: Serato DJ Pro is a powerful software solution that empowers DJs to unleash their creativity, deliver exceptional perf', 700, 'Software', 'https://pub-8ce7dd1a0bfc42fb9e3a130e1f5f5aae.r2.dev/images/products/p1771380448179_main.webp', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771385286007', '4K Video Downloader Plus Pro 26.0.4', 'Overview of 4K Video Downloader Plus Pro for macOS It is an advanced video-downloading software designed for macOS users. This application lets you download videos, audio, subtitles, channels, and playlists from popular platforms like YouTube, Vimeo, Facebook, TikTok, and many more. The software provides an intuitive and user-friendly interface, making it accessible to users of all experience levels.  4K Video Downloader allows you to download video, audio, and subtitles from YouTube in high quality and as fast as your computer and connection will allow. We''ve got you covered if you want that video on your iPad, iPhone, or other device. Downloading is simple and straightforward: copy the video link from your browser and click ''Paste Url.'' Done!  Features of 4K Video Downloader Plus Pro for macOS 4K Video Downloading As the name suggests, this downloader excels in downloading videos in resolutions up to 4K Ultra HD. Whether grabbing a high-quality video or saving space by opting for a lower resolution, the choice is yours. Bulk Downloads and Playlists The software lets you download YouTube channels, playlists, and user accounts with a single click. This feature is particularly useful when you want to download multiple videos simultaneously, saving you time and effort. Extract Audio Only In addition to videos, you can extract audio tracks in various formats such as MP3, M4A, or OGG. This is handy when saving your favorite music or podcasts offline. Subtitle Support 4K Video Downloader Plus Pro can download and save subtitles and videos. It supports subtitles in multiple languages, making it easier to enjoy foreign-language content. One-Click Mode This mode lets you set your preferred download settings once and apply them to all future downloads, streamlining the downloading process. Smart Mode The Smart Mode feature lets you apply specific download settings to your videos, such as quality, format, and subtitles. It saves your preferences, ensuring consistent downloads with minimal manual effort. In-App Proxy Setup The application offers an in-app proxy setup to bypass geographical restrictions and download region-locked content. This enables access to videos that might otherwise be unavailable in your country. Cross-Platform Support While we focus on the macOS version in this article, it''s worth noting that 4K Video Downloader is also available for Windows and Ubuntu, allowing you to switch between platforms without losing your preferences and downloaded content. Technical Details and System Requirements macOS 10.13 or later  FAQs Q: Is 4K Video Downloader Plus Pro legal to use? A: Yes, 4K Video Downloader Plus Pro is a legal software that enables users to download videos for personal use. However, it is essential to respect copyright laws and the terms of service of the respective video platforms.  Q: Can I download videos from YouTube using this software? A: Yes, 4K Video Downloader Plus Pro supports downloading videos from YouTube and several other popular platforms.  Q: Is there a limit on how many videos I can download? A: There are no specific limitations on the number of videos you can download. You can download as many videos as you want with sufficient space on your hard drive.  Q: How often does the software receive updates? A: The software is regularly updated to ensure compatibility with video platforms and to introduce new features and improvements.  Q: Can I download 360-degree and 3D videos? A: Yes, 4K Video Downloader Plus Pro supports downloading 360-degree and 3D videos, providing an immersive viewing experience.  Conclusion 4K Video Downloader is a powerful and versatile tool that simplifies the process of downloading videos from various platforms. Its user-friendly interface, extensive features, and compatibility with multiple resolutions make it an excellent choice for macOS users who frequently download online videos.  With this application, you can enjoy your favorite videos offline and build an impressive video library for future enjoyment. So, whether you''re a casual viewer or a content creator, 4K Video Downloader Plus Pro is a valuable addition to your macOS toolkit.', 0, 'Software', 'https://pub-8ce7dd1a0bfc42fb9e3a130e1f5f5aae.r2.dev/images/products/p1771385286007_main.webp', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771385763244', 'MediaHuman YouTube Downloader 3.9.18 (1602)', 'Overview of MediaHuman YouTube Downloader  There are many exciting things on YouTube, but you can''t download the videos or save them as audio files by default. That''s why we developed YouTube Downloader. This app will help you to accomplish video downloads quickly and without hangups. Using our program, you can download an entire YouTube playlist or channel at once and watch it whenever and wherever you want.  The application has many other convenient and practical functions to explore and enjoy. MediaHuman YouTube Downloader is a handy application for those who found a favorite music video or trailer of a new movie and want to keep it on their computer for viewing offline. Or you need to download a video lesson/tutorial. This video downloader is an ideal solution for such kinds of tasks.  Features of MediaHuman YouTube Downloader Simultaneous downloads Supports Ultra High resolutions including 4K & 8K Downloads entire playlists and channels YouTube, Vimeo, Dailymotion, Soundcloud, and many more VEVO support has also been added in the latest version Extracts audio track and saves it as MP3 Supports exporting to iTunes Works on all modern platforms (macOS, Windows, and Ubuntu) Available as multilingual, you can use it in your native language. System Requirements and Technical Details Supported OS: Windows 11, Windows 10, Windows 8.1, Windows 7 RAM (Memory): 2 GB RAM (4 GB recommended) Free Hard Disk Space: 200 MB or more', 0, 'Software', 'https://pub-8ce7dd1a0bfc42fb9e3a130e1f5f5aae.r2.dev/images/products/p1771385763244_main.webp', 1);
