INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771565349801', 'Pioneer DJ DDJ-REV5 4-deck DJ Controller', 'Category	Feature Compatible DJ Software	- Serato DJ Pro (license required) - rekordbox (Mac/Windows, iOS/Android) System Requirements	Visit serato.com and rekordbox.com for specifications Accessories	AC Adaptor, Power Cord, USB Cable, Warranty (select regions), Quick Start Guide, Precautions for Use, Serato DJ Pro Pitch ’n Time DJ Voucher Dimensions	Width: 28.98 in (736 mm), Depth: 14.85 in (377 mm), Height: 2.89 in (73.4 mm), Weight: 13.67 lb (6.2 kg) Audio Specs	Soundcard: 24-bit/48 kHz, Signal-to-Noise Ratio: 110 dB, Distortion: < 0.003% (USB), Frequency Range: 20 Hz–20 kHz Power	DC 5V, 3000 mA (via USB Type-C) Performance Control	Channels: 2, Deck Control: 4 (Dual), Jog Wheel: 206 mm, Sampler: 8 slots x 4 banks, Hot Cues: 8, Auto Loop/Auto Beat Loop: Yes Pad Modes (rekordbox)	Hot Cue, Pad FX 1, Beat Jump, Sampler, Keyboard, Piano Play, Beat Loop, Sample Scratch Pad Modes (Serato)	Hot Cue, Roll, Saved Loop, Sampler, Pitch Play, Piano Play, Stems, Scratch Bank, Saved Flip, Slicer Loop Terminals	Inputs: 2 MIC (XLR & 1/4 inch TRS Jack, 1/4 inch TRS Jack), 1 AUX (RCA) Outputs: 2 MASTER (XLR, RCA), 1 BOOTH (1/4 inch TRS Jack), 2 PHONES (1/4-inch stereo jack, 3.5-mm stereo mini-jack) USB: 3 USB Type-C ports (2 for PC/Mac connection, 1 for power)', 220000, 'DJ Controllers', 'https://pub-8ce7dd1a0bfc42fb9e3a130e1f5f5aae.r2.dev/images/products/p1771565349801_main.png', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771566145861', 'Rane one DJ Controller', 'The Rane one dj controller  is a premium, motorized DJ controller designed for a vinyl-like experience, offering a highly tactile and professional performance for scratch DJs and turntablists.  The ONE incorporates two 7.2″ motorized turntable platters for a traditional vinyl feeling, complete with customizable (low/high) torque settings. The unit provides an authentic, tactile control over your music and performance with the foundation art of DJing at its very core, including a traditional turntable plunger style start/stop button.  Other notable features include 8 multicolor velocity-sensitive performance pads per deck, each assignable to Hot Cues, Saved Loops, Roll, Sampler, Slicer, and Serato’s Scratch Bank feature. There are six radio-style FX buttons, which can be activated in any combination. Each channel offers a 3-band dynamic EQ and high/low pass filters, as well as dedicated loop controls.  Benefits At a Glance 7.2″ motorized platters with quick-release acrylic disks Trusted RANE build quality and feel Instant access software FX with two metal FX paddles Ultralight MAG FOUR crossfader High/low-pass filter and 3-band EQ Dedicated loop Controls Independent multimode performance pads including Serato Scratch Banks Turntable style start/stop XLR main and booth outputs Two line/phono inputs Two TRS/XLR microphone inputs Two USB computer connections Portable DJ controller Serato DJ Pro Included (paid upgrade to Serato DVS) Control and Effects Craft your sound with RANE ONE’s multifunction, independent performance pads, giving you access to Hot Cues, Saved Loops, Roll, Sampler, Slicer and Serato’s Scratch Bank feature. With six radio-style FX buttons, instantly activate any combination of software FX with a single press, fine-tune with depth and beat parameter controls, then activate with the independent aluminum paddle controls. Finally, take full control of your sound with the 3-band dynamic EQs and high-/low-pass filters on each deck along with dedicated loop controls. Connections Each deck is switchable between 2 USB laptop connections as well as a line input that’s switchable to phono for traditional turntables. Amplify your music through RANE’s pro audio circuitry to the balanced main & booth XLR outputs, and additional RCA main out. There are two dual TRS/XLR microphone inputs alongside an auxiliary input, giving you up to 5 sources of audio to mix. Precision Cuts The ONE’s crossfader features the latest MAG FOUR fader, RANE’s lightest and smoothest fader, ever. With front-panel controls for fast/slow contour adjustment, internal tension adjust, reverse switch, and a new to Serato software cut-in adjustment control, DJs will be able to get just the right feel they need for maximum performance. Dedicated Loop Featuring a dedicated loop section, the ONE allows DJ’s to loop section of a track at the touch of a button with double and half controls instantly accessible. Relooping and manual in/out controls are also available to ensure complete freedom in track and mix control. RANE DJ ONE Specs Configuration	Dual-Deck Number of Channels	2 x Stereo Platter/Jog Wheel	2 x 7.2″ / 18.3 cm Touch-Sensitive Faders	2 x Channel Level 2 x Tempo/BPM 1 x Crossfader Display	None Sample Pads	8 x Assignable per Deck (Velocity-Sensitive) EQ	2 x Channel EQ: Hi Mid Low Performance Controls	BPM Counter, Beat Sync, Brake, Cues, EQ, Echo, FX, High-Pass Filter, Key Lock, Loop Points, Low-Pass Filter, Master Tempo, Pitch Bend, Pitch Control, Reverse, Sampler, Scratch, Search, Transport Controls, Vinyl Mode Sample Rates	48 kHz (AD/DA Conversion) Bit Depths	24-Bit (AD/DA Conversion) Connectivity Audio Inputs	2 x Combo XLR-1/4″ 3-Pin Balanced Mic Input 2 x Stereo RCA Coaxial Unbalanced Line/Phono Input 1 x Stereo RCA Coaxial Unbalanced Aux Input Audio Outputs	4 x XLR 3-Pin Balanced Booth/Master Output 1 x Stereo RCA Coaxial Unbalanced Master Output 1 x 1/4″ TRS Headphone Output 1 x 1/8″ / 3.5 mm TRS Headphone Output USB	2 x USB-B 2.0 (Host Connection) Wireless	None Wireless Connectivity	None Media Card Slots	None Internal Drive Bays	None Performance Input Level	XLR Mic: 110 mV Stereo RCA Aux/CD: 4 Vrms Stereo RCA Phono: 106 mV (RIAA) Output Level	XLR Booth/Master: 8 Vrms Stereo RCA Master: 4 Vrms Headphone: 108 dB Headphone Output Power	1/4″: 50 mW per Channel into 50 Ohms 1/8″ / 3.5 mm: 50 mW per Channel into 50 Ohms Dynamic Range	AD/DA Conversion: 113 dB Stereo RCA Line: 110 dB System: 113 dB THD+N	Stereo RCA Aux/CD/Line/Master: 0.004% Compatibility Included Software	Serato DJ Pro Compatible Software (Not Included)	Serato DJ DVS Algoriddim djay Pro OS Compatibility	Windows macOS iOS Android *As of March, 2023: Check with manufacturer for the most up-to-date compatibility Mobile App Compatible	Yes, Adapter Required (Not Included): Android & iOS App Name: algoriddim djay Pro *As of March, 2023: Check with manufacturer for the most up-to-date compatibility Mobile Device Compatibility	iPhone iPad Required Hardware	USB 2.0 Port ', 290000, 'DJ Controllers', 'https://pub-8ce7dd1a0bfc42fb9e3a130e1f5f5aae.r2.dev/images/products/p1771566145861_main.webp', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771537098798', 'Oraimo BoomPop Lite(White B)Headphones OHP-317', 'Battery Life: Up to 60-65 hours playtime. Fast Charge: 10-minute charge provides 600 minutes (10 hours) of playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, 3.5mm AUX cable, and dual-device connection. Audio: 40mm drivers with Sound360 Spatial Audio. Microphone: AI-powered Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC). Design: Foldable, retractable, with soft ear cushions. Game Mode: Low-latency mode. Charging Port: USB Type-C. Range:   10 meters.', 2500, 'Audio Equipment', 'https://pub-8ce7dd1a0bfc42fb9e3a130e1f5f5aae.r2.dev/images/products/p1771537098798_main.jpeg', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771658024061', 'Refurbished Apple MacBook Pro 2012 13″, Intel Core i5 processor, 4 GB RAM, 500 GB Hard Drive, Intel HD 3000 Graphics, Mac OS', 'Display 13.3-inch (diagonal) LED-backlit glossy widescreen display with support for millions of colors Supported resolutions: 1280 by 800 (native), 1152 by 720, 1024 by 640, and 800 by 500 pixels at 16:10 aspect ratio; 1024 by 768, 800 by 600, and 640 by 480 pixels at 4:3 aspect ratio; 1024 by 768, 800 by 600, and 640 by 480 pixels at 4:3 aspect ratio stretched; 720 by 480 pixels at 3:2 aspect ratio; 720 by 480 pixels at 3:2 aspect ratio stretched Graphics and video support Intel HD Graphics 3000 with 384MB of DDR3 SDRAM shared with main memory5 Dual display and video mirroring: Simultaneously supports full native resolution on the built-in display and up to 2560 by 1600 pixels on an external display, both at millions of colors FaceTime HD camera Thunderbolt port Thunderbolt digital video output Native Mini DisplayPort output DVI output using Mini DisplayPort to DVI Adapter (optional) VGA output using Mini DisplayPort to VGA Adapter (optional) Dual-link DVI output using Mini DisplayPort to Dual-Link DVI Adapter supports 30-inch Apple Cinema HD Display (optional) HDMI audio and video output using a third-party Mini DisplayPort to HDMI Adapter Input Full-size backlit keyboard with 78 (U.S.) or 79 (ISO) keys, including 12 function keys and 4 arrow keys (inverted “T” arrangement) Multi-Touch trackpad for precise cursor control; supports inertial scrolling, pinch, rotate, swipe, three-finger swipe, four-finger swipe, tap, double-tap, and drag capabilities Processor and memory 2.3GHz dual-core Intel Core i5 processor with 3MB shared L3 cache or 2.7GHz dual-core Intel Core i7 processor with 4MB shared L3 cache 4GB (two 2GB SO-DIMMs) of 1333MHz DDR3 memory; two SO-DIMM slots support up to 8GB Storage  500GB 5400-rpm Serial ATA hard drive; optional 500GB 5400-rpm hard drive or 128GB, 256GB, or 512GB solid-state drive6 8x slot-loading SuperDrive (DVD±R DL/DVD±RW/CD-RW) Maximum write: 8x DVD-R, DVD+R; 4x DVD-R DL (double layer), DVD+R DL (double layer), DVD-RW, DVD+RW; 24x CD-R; 10x CD-RW Maximum read: 8x DVD-R, DVD+R, DVD-ROM; 6x DVD-ROM (double layer DVD-9), DVD-R DL (double layer), DVD+R DL (double layer), DVD-RW, DVD+RW; 24x CD Battery and power7 Up to 7 hrs wireless web Built-in 63.5-watt-hour lithium-polymer battery 60W MagSafe Power Adapter with cable management system MagSafe power port Electrical and operating requirements Line voltage: 100V to 240V AC Frequency: 50Hz to 60Hz Operating temperature: 50° to 95° F (10° to 35° C) Storage temperature: -13° to 113° F (-24° to 45° C) Relative humidity: 0% to 90% noncondensing Maximum operating altitude: 10,000 feet Maximum storage altitude: 15,000 feet Maximum shipping altitude: 35,000 feet Software Mac OS X v10.6 Snow Leopard (includes iTunes, Time Machine, Quick Look, Spaces, Spotlight, Dashboard, Mail, iChat, Safari, Address Book, QuickTime, iCal, DVD Player, Photo Booth, Front Row, Xcode Developer Tools) iLife (includes iPhoto, iMovie, iDVD, iWeb, GarageBand)', 20000, 'Laptops', 'https://pub-8ce7dd1a0bfc42fb9e3a130e1f5f5aae.r2.dev/images/products/p1771658024061_main.jpeg', 1);
